{"id":"1e44a603d4403766","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-cusp-form.md","title":"Cusp Form","display":"df-cusp-form — Cusp Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cusp-form","aliases":["58-df-cusp-form"],"display":"df-cusp-form — Cusp Form","depends_on":["[[58-df-modular-form]]","[[58-df-modular-group]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cusp-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cusp-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cusp-form — Cusp Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"58-df-modular-form\">58-df-modular-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" href=\"?note=dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" title=\"58-df-modular-group\">58-df-modular-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(f:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span> (complex-valued function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (weight)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\leq PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\">\\(\\Gamma\\leq PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\)</span> (modular subgroup, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" href=\"?note=dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" title=\"58-df-modular-group\">58-df-modular-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S\\)</span> (modular-form predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"58-df-modular-form\">58-df-modular-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\">\\(\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\">\\(h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\)</span> (cusp representatives, scaling matrices, and widths)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"58-df-modular-form\">58-df-modular-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (explicit witness predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S(f,k,\\Gamma,C,\\sigma,h)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\land\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\land h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\land a(0)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S(f,k,\\Gamma,C,\\sigma,h)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\land\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\land h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\land a(0)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form}\\vdash\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C,\\sigma,h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S(f,k,\\Gamma,C,\\sigma,h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form}\\vdash\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C,\\sigma,h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CuspFormWitness}_S(f,k,\\Gamma,C,\\sigma,h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cusp forms are modular forms whose Fourier constant term vanishes at every cusp.</li>\n<li>Cusp representatives, scaling matrices, widths, and coefficient sequences are quantified explicitly; no undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cusps}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cusps}\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0\">\\(a_0\\)</span> operator remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]"